OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with showers
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a mostly dry
OL,7,Fmorning. A few more showers develop
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, potentially
OL,9,Fturning heavy with a risk of hail and
OL,10,Fthunder later. Light winds freshening
OL,11,Fin the showers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly dry start to the
OL,14,Fevening with any showers quickly
OL,15,Fclearing away eastwards. Turning drier
OL,16,Fand clearer overnight, though perhaps
OL,17,Fa few more showers returning by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
