OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FMostly dry and bright at
OL,6,Ffirst, with just a few showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping through the morning.
OL,8,FShowers becoming heavier with a chance
OL,9,Fof thunder in the afternoon. Slightly
OL,10,Fcooler than Wednesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing but becoming more settled
OL,16,Fagain by Sunday with sunny spells
OL,17,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
